# TCSA-Web

Before editing, read `AGENTS.md`. Specs live under `docs/` — start at `docs/README.md`.

This repo is a public marketing site (React + Vite, Django/DRF, Postgres, S3). It is not a membership platform yet. The only API write path is `POST /api/events/<id>/register/`.

## Do not overload these names

- `Member` = exec org chart (`/api/members/`), not paying students
- `/joinus` = exec recruitment via EmailJS, not membership join
- `Registration` = anonymous event RSVP, not member-gated signup

Paid membership needs new models and `/membership*` routes. See `docs/TCSA_Membership_System_Requirements.md`.

## Working rules

- Match existing file placement: pages in `frontend/src/pages/`, API in `backend/api/`
- No secrets in source; use env vars
- Do not refactor unrelated pages while shipping a feature
- After UI/routing/state changes, verify in the browser
